{"articleNo":"175615","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=175615&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017 대한민국 인재상 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.07.12","hit":"2863","attachments":[{"name":"2017 대한민국 인재상 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=175615&attachNo=77611"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대한민국을 대표할 창의·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">융합 인재를 발굴</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">격려하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, 4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">차 산업혁명 시대를 선도할 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">인재육성에 대한 사회적 관심을 제고하기 위해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2017 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대한민국 인재상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">선발하고 있으니 학생들의 많은 관심 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 신청서류 관련 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청자의 경우 추천서에 학교직인을 받아야 하므로 <font color=\"#000000\"><strong>7.28.(금)까지 본관 101호 학생지원팀(054-478-7067)으로 관련 서류 제출[기한엄수]</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/fdb0a1b9-5b69-4ebe-ad45-d92ba7606f18.jpg\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
